        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur GVCCOVCOM, Grande Victorian Entryset with Coventry Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nReady for something that will add a since of history to your older home? Grandeur's Grande Victorian Entryset with Black Glass Coventry Knob is a stunning pairing or ornate detail work and the romantic beauty of a glass knob. The Coventry Knob is black, adding not only drama to this front door lockset, but also a more modern take on the ornate. The Grande Victorian Entryset with Coventry Knob is available in a wide array of finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Entry Set:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by key from the exterior and by turn unit on the interior. A knob operates the door latch from both interior and the exterior.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nClick here to see the entire <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-decorative\"><b>Grandeur</b></a> - <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-grande-victorian-series\"><b>Grande Victorian Series</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grande Victorian Plate with Coventry Knob and Single Cylinder Deadbolt Combo Pack:\r\n</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>One inch throw deadbolt.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Grande Victorian Entryset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Rosette and Deadbolt Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Knob Material: Black Glass</li>\r\n<li>Grande Victorian Plate Height: 8.28\"</li>\r\n<li>Grande Victorian Plate Width: 2.80\"</li>\r\n<li>Coventry Knob Diameter: 2.30\"</li>\r\n<li>Coventry Knob Projection: 2.44\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt Height: 4.42\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt Width: 2.80\"</li>\r\n<li>Thumb Turn Projection: 1.65\"</li>\r\n<li>Lock Cylinder Projection: 0.76\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-GVCCOVCOM-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262384\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur GVCCOVCOM Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
